          </p>
          <pre class="text-xs bg-(--color-bg-elev) p-3 rounded-md font-mono overflow-x-auto text-(--color-text-dim)">git clone https://github.com/Pamela-ruiz9/sfm-monitor
cd app && npm install && npm run build</pre>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-(--color-text-mute)">
